---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer | wagecheck"
  description="Financial and tax guidance disclaimer for wagecheck calculators. Estimates based on 2026/27 HMRC guidance."
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 via-white to-lime-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-emerald-700">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">
          Financial &amp; Tax Guidance <span class="font-display italic text-emerald-600">Disclaimer</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600 sm:text-xl">
          Important information about using our calculators
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: August 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-400 bg-amber-50 p-6">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-amber-500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008Z" /></svg>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-800">General guidance only</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-amber-700">This website provides general guidance only and does not constitute professional financial, legal, or tax advice.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 px-8 py-6">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008Z" /></svg>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Estimates Only</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">All calculations on wagecheck are estimates based on 2026/27 HMRC guidance published at the time of writing. Tax rates, thresholds and allowances can change at any time — for example, in a Budget or Autumn Statement. We aim to update our rates promptly when changes are announced, but there may be a delay between an announcement and our updates going live.</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Your actual take-home pay may differ from our estimates due to factors not covered by our calculators, such as company benefit-in-kind taxation, court-ordered deductions, or HMRC coding notice adjustments.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 px-8 py-6">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z" /></svg>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Not Professional Advice</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">wagecheck is a free educational tool, not a regulated financial adviser or accountant. Nothing on this site constitutes financial advice, tax advice or any other form of professional advice. You should not rely on the results of our calculators as the sole basis for any financial decision.</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">If you need advice specific to your circumstances, consult a qualified accountant, tax adviser or financial planner who can consider your individual situation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 px-8 py-6">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z" /></svg>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Accuracy</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">We verify our calculations against HMRC published rates and test them with known salary figures. However, we cannot guarantee that every calculation is free from error, nor that it applies correctly to every individual circumstance.</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">If you find an error in any of our calculators, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@wagecheck.co.uk" class="font-semibold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700">hello@wagecheck.co.uk</a> so we can investigate and correct it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 px-8 py-6">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 13.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375H8.25m0 12.75h7.5m-7.5 3H12M10.5 2.25H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 0 0-9-9Z" /></svg>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Liability</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">To the fullest extent permitted by law, wagecheck accepts no liability for any loss or damage arising from the use of, or reliance on, the information provided by our calculators. This includes but is not limited to direct, indirect, incidental or consequential losses.</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">By using this website, you acknowledge that you have read this disclaimer and agree to its terms.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated: August 2026</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
